  "id": "correlation-coefficient",
  "term": "correlation coefficient",
  "definition": "A correlation coefficient is a number that shows how strongly two sets of scores are related. In assessment, it can be used to describe things like a moderate positive association between measures or strong stability in scores over time when the value is high.",
